### Course Creation Studio
- **New Feature**: Implemented a "Studio" style course creation page at `/instructor/courses/new`.
- **Live Preview**: Instructors can see a real-time preview of their course card as they fill in the details.
- **Modern UI**: Split-screen layout with sticky preview and animated success states.
- **Backend Sync**: Fully integrated with `POST /api/courses` to save data to the primary tenant.
- **New Component**: Added the [Textarea](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/components/ui/textarea.tsx#4-6) UI component to the design system.
- **Data Fetching Fix**: Updated the main courses page to fetch real data from the API instead of using mock data, ensuring newly created courses appear instantly.
- **Edit Feature**: Instructors can now edit existing courses using a dynamic Studio interface at `/instructor/courses/[id]/edit`.
- **View Feature**: A detailed course overview page at `/instructor/courses/[id]` with curriculum and stats support.
- **Auth Persistence Fix**: Resolved an issue where reloading the dashboard would prematurely redirect the user to the login page. The application now correctly waits for the session to be restored from local storage.
- **Roles Master Table**: Transitioned from simple string roles to a formal Master Table architecture with a [roles](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/app/Models/User.php#32-39) table and `role_user` pivot table, providing more flexibility for future permissions.
- **RBAC Enforcement**: Implemented [CheckRole](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/app/Http/Middleware/CheckRole.php#9-32) middleware in the backend and applied it to protect Course management routes. Updated the frontend [Sidebar](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/components/shared/Sidebar.tsx#49-112) to dynamically filter navigation based on the user's master roles.
- **Test Refactoring**: Updated [AuthTest](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Auth/tests/Feature/AuthTest.php#10-68) and [CourseTest](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Courses/tests/Feature/CourseTest.php#11-67) to be compatible with the new Roles architecture, ensuring the test suite correctly validates master-role assignments and protected routes.

